# Mistakes log — courier-ops

## 2026-08-07 — clean-engineering-model.md

**Artifact:** `sandbox/courier/.context/clean-engineering-model.md`
**Rule:** `clean_engineering-templates` — separate model and specification fidelity sections

**Wrong:** Collapsed all classes into a single `## Specification fidelity` section using `### Type : IType` heading format; the `## Model fidelity` section was entirely absent. `I{Type}` interfaces and concrete implementations were mixed under one heading, making model and spec detail indistinguishable and breaking the drawio transform (it saw one undifferentiated blob).

**Correct:** Per the shopping-cart canonical example — two separate sections: `## Model fidelity` (all `I{Type}` blocks, no `+` prefix, compact typed contracts) followed by `## Specification fidelity` (concrete `{Type}` blocks with `+` prefix, relationship markers, invariants, interactions). Each section is independent — model adds typed shape, spec fills in the behavior.

**When:** spec / generate / gen-ce pass — clean-engineering-model.md written without model section

